- Merge branch 'for-7.1/winwing' into for-linus (Jiri Kosina)
- Merge branch 'for-7.1/core-v2' into for-linus (Jiri Kosina)
- Merge tag 'v7.1-rc-part1-smbdirect-fixes' of git://git.samba.org/ksmbd (Linus Torvalds)
- Merge tag 'livepatching-for-7.1' of git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/livepatching/livepatching (Linus Torvalds)
- Merge tag 'm68k-for-v7.1-tag1' of git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/geert/linux-m68k (Linus Torvalds)
