- tracing/osnoise: Add option to align tlat threads (Tomas Glozar)
- bpf: Fix precedence bug in convert_bpf_ld_abs alignment check (Daniel Borkmann)
- Merge branch 'emit-endbr-bti-instructions-for-indirect' (Alexei Starovoitov)
- bpf, arm64: Emit BTI for indirect jump target (Xu Kuohai)
- bpf, x86: Emit ENDBR for indirect jump targets (Xu Kuohai)
- bpf: Add helper to detect indirect jump targets (Xu Kuohai)
- bpf: Pass bpf_verifier_env to JIT (Xu Kuohai)
- bpf: Move constants blinding out of arch-specific JITs (Xu Kuohai)
- dt-bindings: display: panel: panel-simple: Add lg,sw49410 compatible (Paul Sajna)
- dt-bindings: display: ti, am65x-dss: Fix AM62L DSS reg and clock constraints (Swamil Jain)
- dt-bindings: display: simple: Move Innolux G156HCE-L01 panel to dual-link (Marek Vasut)
- dt-bindings: display: simple: Move AUO 21.5" FHD to dual-link (Marek Vasut)
- dt-bindings: thermal: Fix false warning with 'phandle' in trips nodes (Rob Herring (Arm))
- of: unittest: fix use-after-free in testdrv_probe() (Wentao Liang)
- of: unittest: fix use-after-free in of_unittest_changeset() (Wentao Liang)
- Merge branch 'for-7.1/module-function-test' into for-linus (Petr Mladek)
- fs/ntfs3: fix Smatch warnings (Konstantin Komarov)
- fs/ntfs3: validate rec->used in journal-replay file record check (Greg Kroah-Hartman)
- Merge tag 'v7.0-rc6' into perf-tools (Namhyung Kim)
- smb: smbdirect: let smbdirect_connection_deregister_mr_io unlock while waiting (Stefan Metzmacher)
- smb: smbdirect: fix the logic in smbdirect_socket_destroy_sync() without an error (Stefan Metzmacher)
- smb: smbdirect: fix copyright header of smbdirect.h (Stefan Metzmacher)
- smb: smbdirect: change smbdirect_socket_parameters.{initiator_depth,responder_resources} to __u16 (Stefan Metzmacher)
- smb: smbdirect: remove unused SMBDIRECT_USE_INLINE_C_FILES logic (Stefan Metzmacher)
- smb: server: no longer use smbdirect_socket_set_custom_workqueue() (Stefan Metzmacher)
- smb: client: no longer use smbdirect_socket_set_custom_workqueue() (Stefan Metzmacher)
- smb: smbdirect: introduce global workqueues (Stefan Metzmacher)
- smb: smbdirect: prepare use of dedicated workqueues for different steps (Stefan Metzmacher)
- smb: smbdirect: remove unused smbdirect_connection_mr_io_recovery_work() (Stefan Metzmacher)
- smb: smbdirect: wrap rdma_disconnect() in rdma_[un]lock_handler() (Stefan Metzmacher)
